# Local override of fast mode's model and effort (`clo f`, `clo here`, `clo 1-4`). Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/clo-fast-defaults
# and keep it there, untracked. Without this file, or a matching line: Sonnet at medium effort.
#
# One line per account: the account name from the claude-accounts file, or * for every
# account, then a model (haiku, sonnet, opus, fable or a full id) and optionally an effort
# (low, medium, high, xhigh, max). An account's own line wins over *. A model number
# (`clo 3`) fixes the model, so only the effort is taken from here.
#
# account   model   effort
*           sonnet  medium
work        opus    high
